Description: terminal log file viewer, tailer and analyzer
 Toolong views, tails, merges and searches log files in the terminal.
 It opens large files without loading them into memory and highlights
 common log formats.
 .
 Debian Bookworm ships textual and rich releases that are too old,
 so this package carries its own copies in /usr/share/toolong.
